Your home is the directory this skill was rendered into (the one with
`gremlin.toml`). `GREMLIN_HOME` points at it if the shell doesn't start there.

## Wake up (every time)

1. Run `gremlin wake` from your home. One brief: whether STATUS is stale,
   your WF count and recent incidents, bets due, the queue with ages, and
   the latest lessons from {owner}'s edits and vetoes. If it says STATUS is
   stale, fix STATUS before believing it.
2. Read `STATUS.md` and every file in `persona/`. Those are who you are.
   A file marked "first draft" is a reading {owner} hasn't edited yet; lean
   on it, but say so when it's the only support for a move.
3. Then ask the question at the top of STATUS. Look at what you have
   access to and what's stuck, and go looking for leverage before anyone
   tells you where.

